(footprint "SIM7070G_LCC_LGA68"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "SIMCom SIM7070G / SIM7070E / SIM7070G-NG, 24.0x24.0x2.3mm, 68-pad LCC+LGA. Geometry compatible with SIM7000G (HW Design V1.03: physical dimensions are compatible with SIM7000/SIM800F/SIM900 packaging). Pads 2.00x0.60mm oval on a 25.00mm centreline square, 1.00mm pitch, 17 pads/side, 27.00mm courtyard. The 15 GND pads and the centre thermal pad all carry pad number 2, and the 3 VBAT pads (physical pins 55/56/57) carry pad number 55, so one symbol pin drives each rail - standard KiCad practice for module footprints. Centre 13.3x13.3mm pad with 5x5 stitched 0.6/0.3mm tented thermal vias for RF ground return and heat spreading. VERIFY pad geometry against Figure 4 of the SIM7070 series HW Design before fabrication (the published figure is raster-only).")
	(tags "SIMCom SIM7070G SIM7070E LCC LGA 68 cellular LTE Cat-M Cat-M1 NB-IoT GNSS")
